"""
patch_L460_drawer_order_20261021.py - the drawer lists each shell where it
begins (L-460): the Sun and Earth rooms.

Built on b334077cd17cd57dff029fd2e3e6bbea445be4aa at
https://github.com/tonylquintanilla/tonyquintanilla.github.io (branch main),
and on orrery c0feb228b7394e488ca752364eefade39ab5349c at
https://github.com/tonylquintanilla/palomas_orrery.

WHAT IT DOES
    Tony's ruling, 2026-10-21: "the order goes by the distance of the
    nearest part of the feature." When a room opens, the page reads each
    shell's served row and lists the shell at the nearest part of it as
    drawn: its inner edge, its nearest dot for a stored drawing, its nose
    for the magnetopause and bow shock, the distance it is drawn at for a
    sphere or ring. Rows that are not shells keep their places. The Solar
    System room is unchanged.

    New files (permanent):
      gallery/drawer_order.js             -- the rule, loaded by the page
      documentation/smoke_drawer_order.js -- the "Drawer order" check (gates)
      tools/headless/walk_drawer_order.js -- Claude's headless walk
      documentation/DRAWER_ORDER_L460_20261021.md -- the order, as Tony saw it
    Edited:
      interactive.html            -- loads the file, plans the order, the
                                     drawer follows it; header stamp
      gallery_maintenance_run.py  -- the "Drawer order" row; the live check
                                     fetches gallery/drawer_order.js; stamp

HOW TO RUN
    Save into the tonyquintanilla.github.io folder, open in VS Code, click
    Run.  (python patch_L460_drawer_order_20261021.py)
    Success: one "ok" line per step, then "patch applied".
    Failure: "ERROR:" or "ANCHOR FAIL", and NOTHING was written.
    Undo is Discard Changes in GitHub Desktop.

AFTER RUNNING
    Move this file to documentation/. Run the Gallery Maintenance Run
    (expect "Drawer order" PASS), commit, push, then the live run. On your
    phone: the Sun room's drawer, then Earth's.

Module written: October 21, 2026 with Anthropic's Claude Opus 5.5.

Role: devtool
Domain: dev_tools
"""

